from what you say.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.434
-I don't see
how that's possible.

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:10.634
-Just don't. Okay?

00:04:10.634 --> 00:04:12.234
-Alright. Fine.
What else can we talk about?

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:13.968
Everyone's talking
about the show "Wednesday" --

00:04:13.968 --> 00:04:17.000
-Ah, wah-wah-wah! No spoilers.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.667
-I was just gonna say the dance
scene is getting a lot of buzz.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:23.167
-Great, Jimmy. Now I know
there's a dance scene.

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:24.667
-Everyone knows
there's a dance scene.

00:04:24.667 --> 00:04:26.901
It's huge on TikTok.
-Great!

00:04:26.901 --> 00:04:29.968
Now I know it's huge on TikTok!

00:04:29.968 --> 00:04:31.701
-Alright. Fine. What else
is there to talk about?

00:04:31.701 --> 00:04:35.234
"Yellowstone" is big right now.
-Ahh-- I haven't seen it.

00:04:35.234 --> 00:04:36.667
-"Violent Night"
is getting good reviews.

00:04:36.667 --> 00:04:39.334
-Haven't seen it.

00:04:39.334 --> 00:04:40.801
