00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:02.834
-Donald Trump --

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:05.133
-He won the election?!

00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:07.667
-Christmas is almost here.
-It is?

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.567
-Alright. That's enough.
You're behind on everything.

00:05:09.567 --> 00:05:11.100
