this whole time?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:15.801
-Wordle. I'm actually doing
today's puzzle right now.

00:05:15.801 --> 00:05:17.767
-Well, get a load of this.
It's actually woken.

00:05:17.767 --> 00:05:20.901
W-O-K-E-N.
"Woken" is the word today.

00:05:20.901 --> 00:05:23.100
-I swear to God.

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:26.200
Mother [bleep]!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:30.033
-Hey, hey, hey! Hey, hey!
Come on, man! Whoa! Hey!

00:05:30.033 --> 00:05:32.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:34.501
Sorry!

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:37.067
Unbelievable. Sorry!

00:05:38.701 --> 00:05:40.801
-Steve: Wow.
-Guys, get this.

00:05:40.801 --> 00:05:43.334
Following a pause
during the pandemic,

00:05:43.334 --> 00:05:45.434
