00:06:27.501 --> 00:06:29.634
-Filter? That was Saturday.

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:31.267
-Oh, my God!

00:06:31.267 --> 00:06:32.801
Moving on. [ Clears throat ]

00:06:36.334 --> 00:06:39.167
Hey, guys, I heard about a
tattoo removal studio in London

00:06:39.167 --> 00:06:42.133
