00:07:38.067 --> 00:07:40.467
Oh, my gosh.

00:07:40.467 --> 00:07:42.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:42.501 --> 00:07:43.734
Wow.

00:07:43.734 --> 00:07:45.701
Alright.

00:07:45.701 --> 00:07:48.334
Now let's see who's gonna
go home with tonight's sweater.

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:50.000
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.834
