-Absolutely.

00:08:39.601 --> 00:08:41.734
-Yeah. Here. Go for it.
This is gonna be fun.

00:08:41.734 --> 00:08:42.968
-Oh, my gosh.

00:08:42.968 --> 00:08:44.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:44.934 --> 00:08:51.567
♪♪

00:08:51.567 --> 00:08:54.367
-You're -- It's very --
